cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Insider Threat Event Requirements (ITER)"
abstract: >-
  A living record of what an insider event obliges in Europe: the event
  types, the reporting acts each one obliges, the term on each, whom it is
  owed to and the point the term runs from, the bodies and addresses a report
  goes to in each jurisdiction, the national acts that move a term, and the
  decided cases on the tests the instruments leave open, each stated from a
  source that has been read.
type: dataset
message: "If you use this record, please cite it."
